    <region left="0" top="6174" width="171" height="45" border="true" color="#000000" bgColor="#ff0000" fontSize="25" isBreakable="false">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p style="background-color: #ff0000; font-size: 25px;">Example 1</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="6228" width="611" height="53" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>Design the prestressing reinforcement in 80 mm thick pretensioned prestressed planks with a 3.6 m<br />simply supported span. The planks will act compositely with 65 mm thick concrete topping eventually.<br />The design data are as follows :</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="6291" width="276" height="38" border="true" color="#000000" bgColor="#80ffff" fontSize="20">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p style="font-size: 20px; background-color: #80ffff;">Service Stress Design</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="9" top="6336" width="139" height="50" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math>
