    <region left="0" top="11430" width="570" height="68" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>Design a 110 mm thick prestressed pretensioned plank simply supported at 7.2 m and acting<br />compositely with 75 mm thick concrete topping. All other design data are to be as per Design<br />Example 1. Design live load is 2.5 kN/m2 and the planks are to be propped at mid-span during<br />installation.</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
